    "tagline": "The electronics supply chain platform",
    "description": "Luminovo is the electronics supply chain platform that helps you quote and procure faster and better by bringing all your data, processes, and players together in one place. Our products for OEM (Design-to-source) and for EMS (Configure-price-quote) are modular and easily tailored to your needs thanks to an array of add-ons specifically built for the electronics industry challenges. \n\nWe are a mix of deep learning natives, business talents and product enthusiasts. Our current team not only includes top graduates from institutions such as Stanford University, Cambridge, ETH Zurich, TUM, and CDTM, but also motivated individuals with rather unconventional CVs who are burning for what they do. Luminovo was born in Munich but has evolved into a remote-first company operating globally and with our team spread from Amsterdam to Valencia, Tirana, and Nairobi. 🌍\n\nIf you're someone working in the electronics industry or looking to grow a software startup – join Luminovo as we pioneer a modern setup of the all-encompassing electronics industry. 🚀",
